      },
      "message": "feat(xtask): the heavy reach reads test-only and binary-only source files\n\nA changed #[cfg(test)] module of a heavy crate now reaches only that\ncrate's lib target, and src/main.rs or src/bin/.. reaches only the bins\nand integration binaries of its crate. Every other file, and every file\nthe module walk cannot prove, keeps the crate reach. The plan names each\nheavy step it does not run and prints the reached and skipped counts.\n\nThe per-module use graph for library files is not in this change: it\nneeds guards for globs, re-exports, trait impls and registries.\n\nRefs #3560\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
