      "message": "fix(xtask): a test-only file is narrow only when no other compile root names it\n\nReview of #3737: the cfg(test) proof read only the lib.rs module tree.\nA `mod t;` in main.rs, or a `#[path]` in tests/ or src/bin, could build\nthe same file into another target. seen_by now reads every .rs file of\nthe crate directory and answers Library when any of them names the file\nor declares one of its modules outside the proven tree. heavy.rs and\nheavy_files_tests.rs are LF again, as on main.\n\nRefs #3560\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
